{
 "id": "vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror",
 "vol": 1,
 "chapter": 2,
 "type": "chapter",
 "title": "Act One — Fortress of Solitude",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[mood:dream_blur]Immortal animal spirit dancing on cave wall — I cannot grasp but merely perceive some primal truth into this quest, inserted dis-honestly.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/000.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust stands up and inspects himself in the mirror.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/001.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "My world of possibility expands with each new breath. They give this drug to shut-ins — agoraphfolk struggling with writer's block.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/002.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "when_flag": "faust_dose",
   "is": 3,
   "text": "Three was the right number. The mirror agrees — a little too readily.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/003.mp3"
  },
{
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "when_flag": "faust_dose",
   "is": 2,
   "text": "Two. The one I put back is still in the bottle, and I can feel it there, waiting its turn.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/004.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust looks at his phone.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/005.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Time to make some work. Dime-this corporate skrill. All the tech-pharm nerds — holla at me, please.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/006.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust exits the office, emerges into the drugstore proper, looks out at the slow medicated trickle of society.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/007.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "bg",
   "src": "3d:pharmacy_floor"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[mood:studio]From my whitewalled fortress of solitude I emerge and bask upon my kingdom — of cheap fluorescents and impulse buys. For I rule it well.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/009.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "hide",
   "pos": "center"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "deborah",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "pos": "right"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Deborah is helping a customer at the front table. Faust saunters up.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/012.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "pos": "left"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person]Everything going great today.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/014.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Deborah",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Bit early to tell.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/015.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Some days I feel like an IV drip.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/016.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Deborah",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Pretty much sums up my view of purgatory.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/017.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "hide",
   "pos": "left"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "old_woman",
   "expr": "warm",
   "pos": "left"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "A customer interrupts — a happy old woman.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/020.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Old Woman",
   "expr": "warm",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person_b]When most the ones my age learn how to be happy, they've already lost so much time. So enjoy it. Be young and happy forever.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/021.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust checks the bottle and hands it over to her.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/022.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "pos": "center"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Another happy customer served.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/024.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Deborah",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Another one who sees the light oncoming.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/025.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person]I feel like Charon ferrying.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/026.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Deborah",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Aptly put.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/027.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "hide",
   "pos": "left"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "eric",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "pos": "left"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust's other assistant, Eric, enters.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/030.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Eric",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Yo yo ma in the hizzouse.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/031.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Deborah",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person_b]What he got in that grill?",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/032.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Eric",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Just a bridge and two f-holes.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/033.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "MC R-I-B is back!",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/034.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust and Eric palm-shake. Eric puts down lunch.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/035.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "I smell me some Vietnamese.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/036.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Deborah is already digging into hers.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/037.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Deborah",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "So good. Give it over.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/038.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Eric",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person]Six eggrolls between the three of us.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/039.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Hint: lunch is on me — because I want three.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_pharmacy_mirror/040.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "jump",
   "scene": "vol1_ch2_park"
  }
 ]
}